{
  "name": "HSC-04 - Stalled Opportunities Follow-up Summary [Dev]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HSC-04 - Stalled Opportunities Follow-up Summary [Dev]\n\n**Owned By:** Ronny Kalaksanan\n**Last Updated:** 2026-08-23\n\n**Description:**\nBagian dari Layer 3 (Segmentation). Mengambil semua contact di active list 'Stalled Opportunities' HubSpot, lalu minta Groq membuat ringkasan follow-up yang actionable untuk tim Alurio.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. TriggerManualTest\n2. SetListId - listId = 13 (Stalled Opportunities)\n3. GetListMembers - GET memberships list dari HubSpot\n4. ExtractRecordIds - ambil array ID contact dari hasil membership\n5. HasMembers - cek ada member atau tidak\n6. GetContactDetails - ambil detail contact (email, nama, lifecycle) via Search API\n7. FormatContactList - susun jadi teks list\n8. GenerateFollowUpSummary - Groq bikin ringkasan actionable\n9. LogSummary / LogSyncError\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- Credential: \"HubSpot Private App Token\" (scope: crm.lists.read, crm.objects.contacts.read)\n- Credential: \"Groq API Key\"\n- List ID Stalled Opportunities: 13 | New Leads This Week: 12",
        "height": 692,
        "width": 748,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8d445cdb-f630-4041-96fb-4d20621430de",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        -464
      ]
    },
